### ─── PropertyLoop Bookmarks, Products & Orders ─────────────────────────────
### Login as buyer
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### Login as agent (to get a listing ID)
# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{agentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{agentPassword}}"
}

### Get a listing
# @name agentListings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/me/all
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### BOOKMARKS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 1. Toggle bookmark — add a property ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityId": "{{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}",
  "type": "PROPERTY"
}

### ═══ 2. Check if bookmarked ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/check?entityId={{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}&type=PROPERTY
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 3. Toggle bookmark — add a vendor ═══
# @name loginVendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{vendorPassword}}"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityId": "{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}",
  "type": "SERVICE"
}

### ═══ 4. List all bookmarks ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 5. List bookmarks by type ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks?type=PROPERTY
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 6. Toggle bookmark — remove (same call again) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityId": "{{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}",
  "type": "PROPERTY"
}

### ═══ 7. Verify removed ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/check?entityId={{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}&type=PROPERTY
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PRODUCTS (public)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 8. List products ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### ═══ 9. List products with filters ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=Cement%20%26%20Concrete&sort=price_asc

### ═══ 10. Search products ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=dangote
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ORDERS (authenticated buyer)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### NOTE: Orders require product IDs from the database.
### If no products are seeded, this will return 400.
### Seed products first, then uncomment and run.

### ═══ 11. Create order ═══
# POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
# Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "recipientName": "Tunde Akinola",
#   "phone": "+2348012345678",
#   "address": "12 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
#   "city": "Lagos",
#   "notes": "Call before delivery",
#   "payMethod": "CARD",
#   "items": [
#     { "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_PRODUCT_ID", "quantity": 10 }
#   ]
# }

### ═══ 12. List buyer's orders ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
